{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國能源部橡樹嶺國家實驗室（ORNL）研究團隊宣佈，他們發現了一種無需改變材料化學組成即可調控磁性的新方法。研究表明，僅通過施加輕微機械應變，就能夠改變某些晶體材料內部的磁結構，並進一步影響其電子傳輸特性。這一發現有望為下一代自旋電子學器件開發開闢新的技術路徑。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1584830.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T07:43:23.267789+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":136,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T07:34:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T07:38:55.410609+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T07:38:55.410609+00:00","content_hash":"90811eaaf518d0e57a80caf6d134ed9ef3e46300bca4ec8e7f1c83a5f37f65a1","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}